[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780259993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2780259993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2780259993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lt2aZ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T06:00:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T06:00:43Z","body":"Hi, what's your motivation for this change?\nI think it makes sense, but it's easier to motivate merging if there's a tangible reason to do so :) \n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780259993/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780648036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2780648036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2780648036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lvVJk","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T10:24:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T10:24:32Z","body":"I am to assume this means the compiler can optimize this function away whenever possible. But, the source code should ideally not contain this method, in favour of the \"Color from int\" constructor, to save on binary size ( CC @Calinou )","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780648036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780673257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2780673257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2780673257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lvbTp","user":{"login":"tomfull123","id":1344693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDQ2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1344693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123","html_url":"https://github.com/tomfull123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T11:28:18Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T11:43:48Z","body":"> Hi, what's your motivation for this change? I think it makes sense, but it's easier to motivate merging if there's a tangible reason to do so :)\r\n\r\nSo in GDScript I'm defining a Dictionary of an enum type to Color, previously I had it defined as a constant variable since it I was using the constructor, but I was dividing the RGB values with 255, so to neaten it up I switched to using the `from_rgba8` method, but in the process had to make it static, I didn't see why it couldn't be const and thought that making the method a constexpr that that \"const\"ness would propagate down to GDScript, or at least this would be the first step and I thought it would be a quick and easy PR to get merged in\r\n\r\nI was too lazy to check if it did propagate down to GDScript, I assume we'll probably need to update the definition that GDScript uses or something, I've not learnt how that bit of the engine works yet\r\n\r\nIts effectively a named constructor, so I think it makes sense","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2780673257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781024081","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2781024081","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2781024081,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lww9R","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T18:09:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T18:13:28Z","body":"> > Hi, what's your motivation for this change? I think it makes sense, but it's easier to motivate merging if there's a tangible reason to do so :)\r\n> \r\n> So in GDScript I'm defining a Dictionary of an enum type to Color, previously I had it defined as a constant variable since it I was using the constructor, but I was dividing the RGB values with 255, so to neaten it up I switched to using the `from_rgba8` method, but in the process had to make it static, I didn't see why it couldn't be const and thought that making the method a constexpr that that \"const\"ness would propagate down to GDScript, or at least this would be the first step and I thought it would be a quick and easy PR to get merged in\r\n> \r\n> I was too lazy to check if it did propagate down to GDScript, I assume we'll probably need to update the definition that GDScript uses or something, I've not learnt how that bit of the engine works yet\r\n> \r\n> Its effectively a named constructor, so I think it makes sense\r\n\r\nI see, thank you for explaining.\r\n\r\nFirst off, let me be clear that I do not have deep insight into GDScript's implementation, but I'm somewhat familiar with compilers and VMs in general.\r\n\r\nWith that said, I think the reason your color cannot be `const` when you use `from_rgba8` is that the function has not been selected for [constant folding](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constant_folding) in the `GDScript` compiler. Some things are constant foldable, but most things aren't. Unfortunately, it cannot not be determined automatically based on `C++` method metadata (like whether it is `constexpr`). \r\nSo, i'm afraid this PR won't help you for the problem you're experiencing.\r\n\r\nIt may be possible to add the function to constant folding functions, but I'm not sure how ready the implementation is to have new functions added to it. You'd have to ask someone more familiar with `GDScript` to get more insight into that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781024081/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781025909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2781025909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2781025909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwxZ1","user":{"login":"tomfull123","id":1344693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDQ2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1344693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123","html_url":"https://github.com/tomfull123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomfull123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T18:14:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T18:14:01Z","body":"Yeah I thought that might be the case, either way I think it makes sense for this method to be constexpr 😊","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781025909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781032036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105035#issuecomment-2781032036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105035","id":2781032036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lwy5k","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T18:28:57Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T18:29:19Z","body":"Agreed, it does make sense!\r\nHowever, we should keep in mind that for Godot, we try to only merge PRs that solve practical problems.\r\n\r\nPerformance optimization could be an interesting use case for the change. However, it looks like it has only one caller, and it's not in a performance critical function. Based on that, I don't think the declaration needs to be changed at the moment.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2781032036/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]